  "notes": [
    "All control.* functions are ADDITIVE to existing UI controls (the AMC arm checkbox, KILL ALL button, Strategies panel ENABLE/KILL buttons remain \u2014 server functions are a parallel rail to the same actions).",
    "EAGLE editing boundaries (PART 36/37/82 only, do-not-touch list) from the reader's guide still apply. The remote surface uses the EXISTING wiring \u2014 the underlying methods above are already implemented in EAGLE/NEXUS; we are EXPOSING them, not building new behavior.",
    "Allow-listed strategy properties for control.strategy.set_setting / control.family.set_setting will be enumerated and shared before wiring (read-only intersection with G_* globals and PXX_* family settings; trade-logic internals are not callable).",
    "Confirm-token flow for nuclear tier: client calls with confirm=true and no token -> server returns status=pending with confirm_token (60s TTL) + announcement frame to fleet subscribers; client repeats call with confirm_token -> server executes. Two-round-trip is intentional friction for catastrophic ops."
  ]
